<Page title="Glossary · SecureLab">
  <h1>Glossary</h1>
  <dl>
    <dt>Authentication</dt><dd>Establishing the identity of an actor.</dd>
    <dt>Authorization</dt><dd>
      Determining whether a verified actor may perform a specific action on a
      resource.
    </dd>
    <dt>Tenant</dt><dd>
      An organization or workspace whose resources share a security boundary.
    </dd>
    <dt>Least privilege</dt><dd>
      Granting the permissions needed for a specific task.
    </dd>
    <dt>Field allowlist</dt><dd>
      The explicitly permitted properties in an input or response.
    </dd>
    <dt>Invariant</dt><dd>
      A condition that must hold for every applicable policy decision.
    </dd>
  </dl>
</Page>
